  "referenceNumber": "DRC0062",
  "remarks": "\nWilliam YAKUTUMBA is an \"involved person\" under the Democratic Republic of the Congo (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because he is or has been involved in the commission of violations of international humanitarian law in the Democratic Republic of the Congo, including rape, mass rape and other forms of sexual and gender-based violence, through his role as leader of the Mai-Mai Yakutumba. \n",
